<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hanover Compressor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hanover Compressor started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage  of Hanover Compressor Co with a market outperformer rating.</p>
<p>-- shares in the natural gas compression equipment company were off  1-7/16 to 22-3/4.</p>
</text>
